\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> (ideal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"58-df-ideal\">58-df-ideal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (cardinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ApproachabilityIdeal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ApproachabilityIdeal}_S\\)</span> (canonical approachability-ideal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"7dccd115a13bf464\" href=\"?note=7dccd115a13bf464\" title=\"58-df-zfc-approachability-ideal\">58-df-zfc-approachability-ideal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLargeApproachabilityIdeal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLargeApproachabilityIdeal}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}large\\text{-}approachability\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLargeApproachabilityIdeal}_S(I,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ApproachabilityIdeal}_S(I,\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}large\\text{-}approachability\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLargeApproachabilityIdeal}_S(I,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ApproachabilityIdeal}_S(I,\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Alias of the canonical approachability ideal. The upstream definition includes the required club-modulo condition and one coherent approachability sequence.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"targ